---
source: crates/runtime-component/src/vector_engine.rs
expression: removed_vector_engine_message()
---
the vector engine `duckdb` is no longer supported as of v2.5 and cannot be used. Remove the `vectors` block and use `acceleration.engine: cayenne`, which indexes embedding columns for `vector_search` itself. See: https://spiceai.org/docs/components/data-accelerators/cayenne/migration#migrating-the-duckdb-vector-engine
